<?xml version="1.0" encoding="us-ascii"?>
<XML ID="EQInterfaceDefinitionLanguage">
  <Schema xmlns="EverQuestData" xmlns:dt="EverQuestDataTypes" />
  <!-- ============================================================
       Modernized buff window (Slate Glass HUD look)
       - each buff is a slate card with a dark well framing its icon; gold edge on hover
       - empty slots are a barely-there outline, so your buffs stand out instead of the grid
       - cards have 2px gaps (the old slot backs touched and formed a heavy grid)
       - buff names in soft white, ending short of the timer so long names never run under it
       - the cards are drawn above the names (with see-through interiors), so the whole card
         highlights and takes clicks, including over the name. (Style_Tooltip false on the
         labels doesn't pass the mouse through here, so the order is what makes it work.)
       Layout: 6 columns x 7 rows = all 42 buff slots, so there's never a partial 7th column.
       6px gap between columns and at both side edges (window width 868), 2px between rows,
       3px top and bottom (window height 175). Buffs fill each column top to bottom.
       ============================================================ -->
